# rfmesh-node.env -- optional overrides for rfmesh-node.service.
# Copy to /etc/rfmesh-node.env if you need to override anything.
#
# By default NO overrides are needed: the startup script reads the Pi's
# CPU serial from /proc/cpuinfo and loads configs/node-<serial>.yaml
# automatically.  SD card swap = zero config change required.

# Uncomment only if you need to force a specific config (e.g. serial
# detection fails, or you want to test a different YAML without renaming it).
# CONFIG=configs/node-abc1234f.yaml

# Uncomment to pin the servo serial port instead of auto-detecting /dev/ttyACM*.
# SERVO_PORT=/dev/ttyACM0
